# turned into the committed 123KB feature matrix. Re-fetch with
#   python eval/fetch_ragbench.py --split train --per-config 300
#   python eval/fetch_ragbench.py --split validation --per-config 120
# Their SHA-256 hashes are recorded in eval/grounding_model_v1.json.
